#!name = 携程每日签到
#!desc = 携程每日定时自动签到（基于 NobyDa 脚本）
#!author = NobyDa
#!homepage = https://github.com/NobyDa/Script
#!icon = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/ctrip.png
